/*!
\page page_sttofdata StTofData

\brief Raw electronic data from a single channel of the legacy TOFp detector system.

\section tofdata_overview Overview

StTofData stores raw ADC and TDC data from a single channel of the legacy TOFp detector system
(TOFp + pVPD), the earliest STAR barrel TOF subsystem.

It is active in early STAR run data and is \b superseded by \ref StTofRawData (Run 5+)
and ultimately by the full BTOF system.

Each object holds one channel's raw ADC and TDC values, plus derived time-calibration (TC) and
slewing-correction (SC) quantities computed during offline reconstruction.
Extended leading/trailing edge TDC fields (mLeadingTdc, mTrailingTdc) were added in the Run 5 format.

Objects are held in \ref StTofCollection via StEvent::tofCollection().

\section tofdata_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StTofData
\endcode

\section tofdata_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mDataIndex | UShort_t | Channel index |
| mAdc | UShort_t | Raw ADC value |
| mTdc | UShort_t | Raw TDC value |
| mTc | Short_t | Time calibration correction |
| mSc | UShort_t | Slewing correction |
| mLeadingTdc | UInt_t | Leading-edge TDC count (Run 5+ format) |
| mTrailingTdc | UInt_t | Trailing-edge TDC count (Run 5+ format) |

\section tofdata_methods Key Methods

- dataIndex() — channel index
- adc() — raw ADC value
- tdc() — raw TDC value
- tc() — time calibration value
- sc() — slewing correction value
- leadingTdc() — leading-edge TDC count
- trailingTdc() — trailing-edge TDC count

\section tofdata_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StTofCollection* coll = event->tofCollection();
if (coll) {
    const StSPtrVecTofData& data = coll->tofData();
    for (const auto& d : data) {
        unsigned short idx = d->dataIndex();
        unsigned short adc = d->adc();
        unsigned short tdc = d->tdc();
        short          tc  = d->tc();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StTofCell, StTofRawData, StTofCollection
*/
